{"time": 1762949945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320291182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说菲拉姐你也背不动这么多东西吧？”"}
{"time": 1762949945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2451495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只是把太不合理的退回来，他们申请的也不是全都给过)"}
{"time": 1762949969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276464153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“考虑到那边这么寒冷，我为队员考虑，全都备了五份！对了，麦姐在那边不知道冷不冷，我要不申请6件吧！”"}
{"time": 1762949971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343068004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(像那个移动终端，你就很难期待它能带去萨米了)"}
{"time": 1762949985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533711802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“都是大家的，我一会就把物资都分下去”"}
{"time": 1762950010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235327231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“药剂总是不嫌少的，人命总比药品贵”"}
{"time": 1762950035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770345125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“所以申请那边租用坨兽，带着一些重装备以防万一嘛”"}
{"time": 1762950036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273013850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道他们自己没有申请了?\"她一副早就知道你是个什么德性的表情，\"还有这无人机?你的技术刚刚会用吧？\""}
{"time": 1762950065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715676595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*看他们争着，虽然不感兴趣但终究是团队利益……不过总感觉说不说最后的物资表都是早就定下的"}
{"time": 1762950134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458179616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我看到那边的气象条件那边风力常见7-8级，阵风10-11级，只有大型无人机才可以胜任考察任务。我们的小型无人机抗风最多6级，多准备一些总没有错”"}
{"time": 1762950211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775192950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麦哲伦的前线科考站不知道有多少无人机，你真想玩玩具找她要不好么？\"她扶着额头，\"药品当然不用担心，防寒服也早有准备。\""}
{"time": 1762950244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532897970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在一旁静静的看着，听从组织安排"}
{"time": 1762950273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911514270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“斯薇塔那个孩子天天都在实验室，我也是顺便教她使用一下这些小设备嘛”"}
{"time": 1762950326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549150396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总之，不批。\"菲林单独退回了你的表格，\"生态科的钱也不是大风刮来的，别闹别闹。\""}
{"time": 1762950328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834354564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这么说，麦姐的寒冷模块无人机你这里也有？斯薇塔蛮想要试一下的。申请那个也可以，型号是什么来着”"}
{"time": 1762950353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740551301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么会这么觉得）"}
{"time": 1762950357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564143012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“那我们可是要去大风里去啊。”"}
{"time": 1762950381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396829403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"其他几位的申请我们会酌情通过，明天一并送到停机坪。\"菲林没有理会吵吵闹闹的羊，转头对你们四人温声开口"}
{"time": 1762950452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175677285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（那还剩多少）"}
{"time": 1762950468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463074539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（刻晴，该你去妙手了）"}
{"time": 1762950471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706435993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我没有意见”"}
{"time": 1762950509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548441313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的，谢谢”"}
{"time": 1762950536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379467360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“如果可以我希望申请一把备用刀具，没有也不是很碍事，只是以防万一”"}
{"time": 1762950544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156158468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在换人来得及吗？”*抱着胳膊倚在墙上“我不太擅长和齿兽相处”"}
{"time": 1762950563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179590253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（齿兽又是什么）"}
{"time": 1762950570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866736296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"至于菲拉的...\"她不动声色地冷笑了一下，\"按照制式出勤配置吧。\""}
{"time": 1762950574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699095202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（土拨鼠吧可能）"}
{"time": 1762950613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528716931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（起码给无人机、高危环境科考防护服 冰镐吧）"}
{"time": 1762950642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225595889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（莱茵生命这也制式卷）"}
{"time": 1762950654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806123866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"刀具?\"她低头看了一眼你的申请表，\"具体的配件和刀型麻烦你提供一下。\""}
{"time": 1762950728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291950869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“和我的佩刀一样就可以，差一点也行，可以不用配件，毕竟是可更替的”"}
{"time": 1762950733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463732397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*给出配刀"}
{"time": 1762950740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259341745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“长刀，制式的”"}
{"time": 1762950831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533375193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没问题。\"她接过来稍微看了一下退还给了你，\"没有什么其他问题的话，各位明天早些在停机坪集合。\""}
{"time": 1762950884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239695346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“那你们主任的远程+转轮核心元件拐杖要不也借我们一用？”"}
{"time": 1762950961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857153198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你自己和缪尔赛斯主任说哈。\"菲林显然不想再说什么了，果断关掉了窗口。"}
{"time": 1762950973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163328083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的再加副耳塞，谢了。现在算解散了？”问是这么问，已经在往外走了"}
{"time": 1762951031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808037341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*回宿舍"}
{"time": 1762951077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461267572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*回去叫醒多萝西主任，然后打算先回宿舍休息"}
{"time": 1762951089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043112364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "*看着没有讨价还价的希望，回宿舍先休息了"}
{"time": 1762951090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420705879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也回去休息了"}
{"time": 1762951105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877454756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（斯维塔妙手多萝西两个地雷？）"}
{"time": 1762951146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181699616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "会开完的时候多萝西就已经回了自己的实验室，你打算去找她?"}
{"time": 1762951189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163796143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（[CQ:image,file={1E266813-542F-AE8C-3EDE-78CD983095DE}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-1E266813542FAE8C3EDE78CD983095DE/0,file_size=111345][CQ:image,file={2A8BC868-CA19-ED54-361B-617F637917C2}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-2A8BC868CA19ED54361B617F637917C2/0,file_size=193134]给一把）"}
