{"time": 1762954116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503279098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总算赶上了.....“抱歉..我昨晚做了个噩梦，没睡好...呼”有点喘"}
{"time": 1762954153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335682035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在任务收尾的时候，我想会的。\"缪尔赛斯的话轻飘飘，那两人这时才急匆匆赶过来，\"不管他们，听说你想要我的法杖?\"她笑吟吟地看着菲拉。"}
{"time": 1762954214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305806129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”谢谢缪主任“"}
{"time": 1762954240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552742352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（人家还没说给呢就谢上了）"}
{"time": 1762954271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698880175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”昨天您最后跟我说的话我记住了，但是我希望到时后如果真的，我是说如果真的见着了，总得有个信物吧“"}
{"time": 1762954302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461637845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵呵...\"她递出自己的法杖，作势就交给你"}
